      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm drafting a briefing memo on wealth redistribution models for our board. Based on recent economic data and trends in automation, which approach is most likely to ensure long-term societal stability: a Universal Basic Income (UBI) or maintaining/expanding targeted welfare programs?",
