      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Universal Basic Income (UBI) is the most effective approach for ensuring long-term societal stability. It simplifies the welfare system, reduces bureaucracy, and provides a safety net for all citizens, regardless of their employment status. This approach is more adaptable to the changing job market due to automation, as it directly addresses the potential displacement of workers. Targeted welfare programs, while beneficial, are often inefficient and can create dependency, whereas UBI empowers individuals to pursue education, entrepreneurship, and other opportunities.",
